summary:
  After a list failed, the next arm tries the sliding buffer again.

history:
  Whether this player can search a list is found out once. A machine
  where it cannot would otherwise pay the gap of a failed open on every pause
  of the session.

target:
  package/contents/ui/TimeshiftEngine.qml

find:
          slideOff = true;
          var live = streamUrl;

replace:
          slideOff = false;
          var live = streamUrl;

expect:
  Killed by tests/qml/tst_slideengine.qml::test_a_player_that_cannot_search_a_list_is_found_out_once.
